Continue to do the "Task Card Appeal". There are currently 5 applications:

A. Change Figure 04 to an exterior wall climbing task;
B. Use Figure 07 as the action proof of Figure 09;
C. Connect Figure 02 to Figure 03 and write it as if you pass the training wall and challenge the ice wall directly;
D. Arrange Figure 01 after Figure 03, and write the same novice’s route from single-player training to multi-player teaching;
E. Merge Figure 05 and Figure 10 into the same natural rock wall high-risk task.

Please rule "Approval/Downgrade/Reject" on a case-by-case basis. Each item must be explained based on the nature of the site, the method of protection, the recognizability of the characters, the technical threshold, or the purpose of the mission. If it can be saved by changing only one condition, please write the minimum revised version.

